{
 "i": "Asking the owner the decisions needed before the build starts",
 "html": "<form>\n<p>Before enyo-ui starts building from iteration 5, five choices. My recommendation is preselected.</p>\n<fieldset><legend>Where to build</legend>\n<p>lenscale.ai is public today (the 1 Nov landing). preview.lenscale.ai already sits behind Cloudflare Zero Trust with Jerry, Nicola and @lenscale.ai allowed.</p>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"where\" value=\"preview\" checked> preview.lenscale.ai: already hidden, no Cloudflare change; lenscale.ai keeps the current landing until you say launch</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"where\" value=\"apex\"> Hide lenscale.ai now: visitors (e.g. from Mario's chat or LinkedIn) hit a login page until launch, and search engines drop it</label>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>Who may see it</legend>\n<p>The other lenscale apps (admin, preview, app) also allow Nicola's Gmail (nicola@example.com).</p>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"who\" value=\"same\" checked> Same as the others: your Gmail, Nicola's Gmail, any @lenscale.ai address</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"who\" value=\"only\"> Only your Gmail and @lenscale.ai addresses</label>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>What first</legend>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"scope\" value=\"site\" checked> The public site (pages 01–13) first; the app pages (14–24) next, restyling app.lenscale.ai</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"scope\" value=\"both\"> Site and app together (slower to a first usable result)</label>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>Open picks in iteration 5 (logo 8 provisional, 4 pricing titles, 3 demo question sets)</legend>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"picks\" value=\"provisional\" checked> Use logo 8, the first pricing title and question set 1 as provisional; change any time</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"picks\" value=\"owner\"> I'll pick first; the build waits</label>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>Where 'Book a demo' requests go</legend>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"form\" value=\"dashboard\" checked> A row in the Team dashboard (Partners) and a Gram to you</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"form\" value=\"email\"> Email to an @lenscale.ai inbox (write which in Other)</label>\n</fieldset>\n</form>"
}
